==Strategy==
The stage starts with Coffin Zoge, 2 Doctor K.O.s, Techn-Old Hyena and Celeboodle. The boss wave is the same, but replaces Coffin Zoge with Oldstrich.

[[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] can stall both of the two main threats in this stage, with any general meatshield being able to wall off Doctor K.O. as well. [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] and/or [[Brainwashed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Island Cat]] works for Oldstrich, meanwhile any ranged attacker with a fast recharge can make quick work of Techn-Old Hyena. [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] fits that role very nicely, and can't be warped by them thanks to his high knockback count. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] are enough to deal with the periodic waves of Doctor K.O.s.

